# Regenerate with: make demo

Output .github/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "export PATH=/vhs/bin:$PATH PS1='$ ' && mkdir -p /tmp/demo && cd /tmp/demo && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "licenses -h"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "licenses list"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type `licenses mit -n "Jane Doe"`
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "head -5 LICENSE"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Type "licenses mit"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
